<del></del></span> Recommended Gear for Unholy Death Knights in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="what-is-the-bis-unholy-death-knight-gear">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_deathknight_unholypresence.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> What is the BiS Unholy Death Knight gear?</h3>With loot scarcity and many different sources of gearing in Mists of Pandaria Classic, targeting your absolute best-in-slot gear isn't entirely realistic; instead, we've created a "Best in Slot" list from the ideal Unholy Death Knight drops found in Phase 4 from raids, dungeons, reputation, and World Bosses to help you decide what to prioritize.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>While raid drops are generally the most reliable way of getting high-ilvl gear, many other items can be just as good, if not better, so you should reference the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/death-knight/unholy/dps-stat-priority-pve"> Stat Priorities for Unholy Death Knights</a> to help determine your own BiS gear based on what is available to you. <br/>
<br/>Further, the value of certain items and stats will depend on how you play the game and how strictly you adhere to the optimal rotations and your willingness to change your rotation based on items.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="bis-gear">Overall Best-in-Slot Gear for Unholy Death Knight</h3>
