<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Unholy Death Knights in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>In Phase 5, the tier bonuses are quite strong, but more so for the 2-set rather than 4-set. The 2-piece set bonus increases your mastery or haste (whichever is highest, likely haste) for 15 seconds every time you proc <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=49530/sudden-doom">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_painspike.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sudden Doom</span></a>, stacking up to 10 times. This buff refreshes its duration every time you gain a new stack, making the amount of stats you receive from this bonus very significant, especially in a raid setting. <br/>
<br/>The 4-set, on the other hand, is very lackluster. <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=47541/death-coil">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_deathcoil.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Death Coil</span></a> increasing the uptime of <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=63560/dark-transformation">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_boss_festergutrotface.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Transformation</span></a> sounds great, but correlates only to a very small increase in throughput. In a full BIS setup, you still go for the 4-set, but it's worth noting that using off-pieces will net you almost the same amount of damage, depending on the length of the fight, meaning you should be low on the priority list for those last two tier tokens.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-16">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 16 - <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item-set=1200/battleplate-of-cyclopean-dread">
