<img alt="Fabled Feather of Ji-Kun" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_priest_angelicfeather.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fabled Feather of Ji-Kun</span></a>, you should do the same with this trinket. Remember to make a cancelaura macro for Unholy Blight to not override the snapshot once the trinket effect fades.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=104463/fusion-fire-core">
<img alt="Fusion-Fire Core" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fusion-Fire Core</span></a> - This is a niche trinket option that is only good in cleave/<wbr/>AOE environments. Very few fights value AOE damage highly, but may find good use cases depending on your raid composition.</div></li>
