<img alt="Fabled Feather of Ji-Kun" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_priest_angelicfeather.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fabled Feather of Ji-Kun</span></a> - Your Phase 4 BIS trinket remains a powerful alternative due to the large amount of strength tied to the proc effect. This trinket is best utilized when snapshotting diseases with <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=115989/unholy-blight">
